Subject: [PATCH 2/4] ggml-metal: kernels for the dense trit types

Mat-vec, MUL_MAT_ID, GET_ROWS and a native dense-trit mat-mat tile on the
tensor-API path (opt-in GGML_METAL_TQD_MM=1) for TQ9_128 / TQ27_128 /
TQ81_128.
